      "calculation_description": "This lookup procedure enriches policy data with source system household numbers by matching policy ID and transaction timestamp.",
      "implementation_notes": "SELECT X.PLCY_ID_SK as PLCY_ID_SK, X.TRANS_TMSP as TRANS_TMSP, X.SRC_SYS_HH_NUM as SRC_SYS_HH_NUM FROM (SELECT A.PLCY_ID_SK as PLCY_ID_SK, A.TRANS_TMSP as TRANS_TMSP, A.SRC_SYS_HH_NUM as SRC_SYS_HH_NUM FROM FDR.FDR_FIRE_PLCY A UNION SELECT B.PLCY_ID_SK as PLCY_ID_SK, B.TRANS_TMSP as TRANS_TMSP, B.SRC_SYS_HH_NUM as SRC_SYS_HH_NUM FROM FDR.PRE_FDR_FIRE_PLCY B) X WHERE PLCY_ID_SK = i_PLCY_ID_SK AND TRANS_TMSP <= i_TRANS_TMSP"
