d as a partitioned transformation within the session pipeline.\n\n- **lkp_STG_TFPLCY_TRAN_RESULT_PRE_FDR_MAPNG_ID**\n  - **Description**: This lookup procedure enriches transaction results with mapping IDs from the staging table, ensuring accurate policy number and effective date matching.\n  - **Logic**: SELECT a.PRE_FDR_MAPNG_ID as PRE_FDR_MAPNG_ID, a.POLICY_NUMBER as POLICY_NUMBER, a.EFF_DT as EFF_DT, a.APPLIED_DTSTMP as APPLIED_DTSTMP FROM STG.STG_TFPLCY_TRAN_RESULT a WHERE a.PRE_FDR_MAPNG_ID <> 0\n\n- **lkp_ABC_WRKFL_CMPNT_OBJ_STG_TO_PRE_FDR_TBL_OBJ_ID_REPROCESSED_ROWS**\n  - **Description**: This lookup procedure is used to enrich data by retrieving specific object IDs for reprocessed rows from the staging to pre-final table. It ensures that only the necessary rows are processed further based on the lookup results.\n  - **Logic**: Connection Information: $DBConnection_FDWS_ABC_ODBC\n\n- **lkp_FDR_FIRE_PLCY_SRC_HH_NUM**\n  - **Description**: Enriches policy data with source system household number using a lookup on FDR_FIRE_PLCY table.\n  - **Logic**: SELECT A.SRC_SYS_HH_NUM as SRC_SYS_HH_NUM, A.PLCY_ID_SK as PLCY_ID_SK, A.EFF_DT as EFF_DT, A.TRANS_TMSP as TRANS_TMSP FROM FDR.FDR_FIRE_PLCY A WHERE PLCY_ID_SK = i_PLCY_ID_SK AND EFF_DT = i_EFF_DT AND TRANS_TMSP = i_TRANS_TMSP\n\n- **lkp_FDR_PARENT_PLCY_PLCY_ID_SK**\n  - **Description**: Enriches policy data with parent policy surrogate key using a lookup on FDR_PARENT_PLCY table.\n  - **Logic**: Lookup condition: SRC_SYS_PLCY_NUM = i_POLICY_NUMBER AND SRC_SYS_CD = i_SRC_SYS_CD AND LOB_CD = i_LOB_CD. Connection Information: $Source. Lookup caching enabled: YES. Lookup policy on multiple match: Use First Value.\n\n- **lkp_FDR_FIRE_PLCY_SRC_HH_NUM_ALTR**\n  - **Description**: This lookup procedure enriches policy data with source system household numbers by matching policy ID and transaction timestamp.\n  - **Logic**: SELECT X.PLCY_ID_SK as PLCY_ID_SK, X.TRANS_TMSP as TRANS_TMSP, X.SRC_SYS_HH_NUM as SRC_SYS_HH_NUM F